body:
Great app! I&#39;ve tried multiple habit trackers in the past and found this one to have the best balance between functionality and aesthetics. However I have two requests;

- I do kind of miss the detailed statistics of habitify, I wish I could see more info in the statistics tab. A completion rate of a select time period/ cards of each habit showing its past records etc would be a great addition

- I personally find the first line of the widget (&#34;you have x habits today&#34;) useless. I wish I had more options of habits to cross out from, but maybe thats just me
